      <div class="cs-field"><b>How we helped</b><span>Chayce created a bespoke plan covering the preparation of the home, sorting, packing, relocation, cleaning, setup and ongoing support after the move.</span></div>
      <div class="cs-field"><b>Outcome</b><span>The family had a single team coordinating the transition, while Robert could focus on settling into his new home rather than managing the logistics.</span></div>
