          <details><summary>What's included in the Platinum Bespoke package?</summary><p>Everything in Gold Prestige, plus a fully bespoke and unlimited scope of service, a personal lifestyle concierge, new area orientation and introductions, an interior designer consultation, 3 months of ongoing post-move concierge support, and a dedicated senior coordinator throughout.</p></details>
