              <details><summary>What does "unlimited scope" actually mean?</summary><p>Platinum Bespoke includes everything in Gold Prestige, plus a fully bespoke, unlimited scope of service tailored entirely to your situation.</p></details>
          <details><summary>Does Platinum include ongoing support after the move?</summary><p>Yes. 3 months of ongoing post-move concierge support is included, along with a dedicated senior coordinator throughout.</p></details>
          <details><summary>What does the 3-month post-move concierge actually involve?</summary><p>Your personal lifestyle concierge stays in touch after the move to help with new-area orientation, introductions to local services and community groups, and anything else that comes up while you settle in.</p></details>
          <details><summary>Can Platinum be tailored if I only need some of these elements?</summary><p>Yes. Platinum Bespoke is fully bespoke by design — your dedicated senior coordinator shapes the scope around what you actually need.</p></details>
          <details><summary>Is Platinum Bespoke fully insured?</summary><p>Yes. All removals carried out by Chayce are fully insured, including Platinum Bespoke.</p></details>
</div>
